=== 5. ECE is a bin artifact; MCB is not ===
    nbins      Kalshi  Polymarket  Sportsbook   best on ECE
        5      0.0058      0.0050      0.0062   Polymarket
        8      0.0125      0.0134      0.0122   Sportsbook
       10      0.0129      0.0128      0.0087   Sportsbook
       12      0.0123      0.0121      0.0155   Polymarket
       15      0.0167      0.0174      0.0161   Sportsbook
       20      0.0191      0.0198      0.0267   Kalshi
       25      0.0169      0.0175      0.0179   Kalshi

  The level roughly triples from 5 to 20 bins and the 'best' venue changes
  with the bin count. That is the bins moving, not the venues.

  ECE at the reported 10 bins, against its binomial noise floor:
  source           ECE   noise floor   ratio
  Kalshi        0.0129        0.0095    1.35x
  Polymarket    0.0128        0.0095    1.34x
  Sportsbook    0.0087        0.0098    0.89x

  READING RULE: report ECE as a LEVEL against this floor, never as a
  ranking. The miscalibration statistic that carries a comparison is MCB
  (section 4), which is isotonic and has no bin count to choose.
